This product ships PDFium (https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/) as a
separate, unmodified shared library beside its own (pdfium.so, pdfium.dll,
pdfium.dylib), taken from the prebuilt archives of pdfium-binaries
(https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries). PDFium is distributed under
the BSD 3-Clause License, with parts under the Apache License 2.0, and it
contains FreeType, ICU, libjpeg-turbo, OpenJPEG, libpng, Little CMS, zlib and
other libraries under their own permissive licenses. THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
reproduces every one of them, and the license of the packaging (MIT).
